event: thinking
data: {"id": "63bd069a365846c6-thinking-parallel_evidence-1182", "run_id": "63bd069a365846c6", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已采集证据汇总：\n\n1. **Pod 状态**：kubectl_get_yaml 和 kubectl_describe 均显示 phase=Running，但 containerStatus.app.ready=False，reason=CrashLoopBackOff，exitCode=78，restarts=6。events 显示最近 10 分钟内 BackOff 事件 x42（51s 前记录）。→ **Pod 仍处于 CrashLoopBackOff 异常状态，未恢复**。\n\n2. **Crash 根因日志**：kubectl_previous_logs 返回崩溃前最后一次启动的容器日志，3 条错误日志一致指向 `CONFIG_MISSING`（HTTP 500，path=/work），trace_id 分别为 `2caa9053590696bdbb2e6c6460529f46`、`b2f1f216f8ee0f499ab0c95ffc51d277`、`2204ca53c671136f2ac9c27fbffb911f`。→ **崩溃原因是应用配置缺失（CONFIG_MISSING）", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788792392231, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "63bd069a365846c6-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "63bd069a365846c6", "seq": 1183, "ts_ms": 1788792403093, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 66.73, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-07", "name": "workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/63bd069a365846c6-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "6f01401182bfc5e682e3714a6b55f368a32fd7072efb72b360059d5bdd5b52aa", "bytes": 2450}, "snapshot_sha256": "c873be66aa7dd22db85e593fb59e48f37cf1985e19ba1b495d6a9a12078afbb7"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

